*-sw.txt and eglinfo-sw.txt: real output of Debian 13's tools (llvmpipe and
lavapipe, under Xvfb). *-virgl.txt, *-venus.txt, vulkaninfo-fail.txt and
guest-info.txt are written by hand in the same shape, for the GPU paths: no
machine here has a GPU. Replace them with real ones from a try.sh --keep run.
